msgstr "传感器配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:50
#: 1b7a778913124be6bff2faec6733e452
msgid ""
"Upon initialization, ArduPilot configures the VectorNav unit as follows:"
msgstr "ArduPilot 在初始化时按如下方式配置 VectorNav 单元："

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:52
#: 3b3844e9d87e4658b497d915e842fcb1
msgid "Configures necessary binary outputs"
msgstr "配置必要的二进制输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:53
#: 7d3ad1827e294668b2faef2b9084910a
msgid "Disables ASCII outputs on both serial ports"
msgstr "在两个串口上禁用 ASCII 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:55
#: 4a958218badb4450bb19aa812ed1a213
msgid ""
"All other necessary configuration parameters must be separately loaded to "
"the VectorNav unit manually."
msgstr "所有其他必要配置参数必须手动单独加载到 VectorNav 单元。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:57
#: 90c0bd48e97e41c184ed153f66c7f8c7
msgid ""
"``Baudrate``: Necessary if increasing the :ref:`EAHRS_RATE<EAHRS_RATE>` "
"above a certain rate. The default baudrate of VectorNav sensors is 115200 "
"bps, but is recommended to increase the baudrate on the sensor to 921600 bps"
" and set :ref:`EAHRS_RATE<EAHRS_RATE>` to 800Hz, if possible."
msgstr ""
"``Baudrate``：在将 :ref:`EAHRS_RATE<EAHRS_RATE>` 提高到一定速率以上时需要设置。VectorNav "
"传感器默认波特率为 115200bps，但建议将传感器波特率提高至 921600bps，并在可能的情况下将 "
":ref:`EAHRS_RATE<EAHRS_RATE>` 设置为 800Hz。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:58
#: ff9aa2dd2d4e4852b4aac8ad141c3c4e
msgid ""
"``Reference Frame Rotation``: Necessary if not mounted as connector-back, "
"base-down configuration."
msgstr "``Reference Frame Rotation``：在非接头朝后、底面朝下安装时需要设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:59
#: 7121efb8009e44bda4511c2affbf1177
msgid ""
"``GNSS Antenna A Offset``: Necessary if using a GNSS-enabled product and the"
" GNSS antenna is mounted more than 10 centimeters from the VectorNav unit."
msgstr ""
"``GNSS Antenna A Offset``：在使用具备 GNSS 功能的产品且 GNSS 天线距 VectorNav 单元超过 10cm "
"时需要设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:60
#: 34487311030c4f0397a54aad7f308703
msgid ""
"``GNSS Antenna Baseline``: Necessary if using a dual-GNSS-enabled product."
msgstr "``GNSS Antenna Baseline``：在使用具备双 GNSS 功能的产品时需要设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:62
#: bd49467bd8d44c42be9b6fe4468a0291
msgid ""
"After setting these parameters, the settings must be set to persist over a "
"power cycle using a **Write Settings** command."
msgstr "设置这些参数后，必须使用 **写入设置** 命令将设置保存以在断电后保持。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:64
#: 309c885b1ead405a9fc4232d404610ef
msgid ""
"For VectorNav register and command definitions, see the relevant model's "
"`Interface Control Document <https://www.vectornav.com/resources/technical-"
"documentation/interface-control-documents>`__."
msgstr ""
"有关 VectorNav 寄存器和命令定义，请参阅相应型号的 `接口控制文档 "
"<https://www.vectornav.com/resources/technical-documentation/interface-"
"control-documents>`__。"

