#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:151
#: eb8014448f694a51add9ade401cb4e99
msgid "ArduPilot Configuration"
msgstr "ArduPilot 配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:152
#: a75ff014427a4dfd840380a96f60dd8a
msgid ""
"There are two possible ways for VectorNav data to be used by ArduPilot: as "
"an external sensor set to ArduPilot's EKFs or as an external AHRS. Both ways"
" utilize ArduPilot's External AHRS driver."
msgstr ""
"VectorNav 数据被 ArduPilot 使用有两种方式：作为 ArduPilot EKF 的外部传感器组，或作为外部 AHRS。两种方式均使用 "
"ArduPilot 的外部 AHRS 驱动程序。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:154
#: caaf4e818c094126bef375a2544c9386
msgid ""
"To establish communication with the VectorNav unit, set the following for "
"the relevant serial port:"
msgstr "要与 VectorNav 单元建立通信，对相关串口设置以下参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:156
#: dfcafee029064876b80a55b4314140a2
msgid "``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` = 36 (AHRS)"
msgstr "``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` = 36（AHRS）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:157
#: 3fea4d5413f049709013dd10dbd30423
msgid "``SERIALx_BAUD`` = matching VectorNav sensor baudrate"
msgstr "``SERIALx_BAUD`` = 与 VectorNav 传感器波特率匹配"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:160
#: 9685976f97b14d40ba2d5f136933c3f2
msgid ""
"The External AHRS-specific parameters may not be visible before the "
"``Serialx_Protocol`` parameter is configured. As such, either a Refresh "
"Params or a reset of ArduPilot may be necessary to see the parameters."
msgstr ""
"在配置 ``Serialx_Protocol`` 参数之前，外部 AHRS 专用参数可能不可见。因此，可能需要刷新参数或重置 ArduPilot "
"才能看到这些参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:163
#: 21d3da7e6a3645e9ae702d2dd37c1e78
msgid "Use as an External Sensor Set"
msgstr "用作外部传感器组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:164
#: d370810db0c849ddb36fc31983dcacaa
msgid ""
"If set up as an external sensor, VectorNav's raw sensor data (IMU, GNSS, "
"Compass, Barometer, and GNSS, if available) can be used by ArduPilot's "
"internal EKFs, as configured. After the serial parameters have been "
"configured, configure:"
msgstr ""
"如果设置为外部传感器，VectorNav 的原始传感器数据（IMU、GNSS、罗盘、气压计及 GNSS，如可用）可按配置供 ArduPilot 内部 "
"EKF 使用。配置串口参数后，请配置："

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:166
#: a572853d1a53472497f6c32179a3c6c9
msgid ":ref:`AHRS_EKF_TYPE<AHRS_EKF_TYPE>` = 3 (ArduPilot’s EKF3)"
msgstr ":ref:`AHRS_EKF_TYPE<AHRS_EKF_TYPE>` = 3（ArduPilot 的 EKF3）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:167
#: dac62214340a4f11a7fe6d4fa149e20b
msgid ":ref:`EAHRS_TYPE<EAHRS_TYPE>` = 1 (VectorNav)"
msgstr ":ref:`EAHRS_TYPE<EAHRS_TYPE>` = 1（VectorNav）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:168
#: 42b5e3f28947492aa153226cfd6a845e
msgid ""
":ref:`EAHRS_OPTIONS<EAHRS_OPTIONS>` bit 0 set to \"1\" value to disable "
"ArduPilot's use of the bias-compensated IMU data, letting ArduPilot's "
"filters do that (optional)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`EAHRS_OPTIONS<EAHRS_OPTIONS>` 第 0 位设为 「1」 以禁用 ArduPilot 对偏置补偿后的 IMU "
"数据的使用，让 ArduPilot 的滤波器自行处理（可选）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:169
#: fecfbee6e95248929a68635658d616ae
msgid ""
":ref:`GPS1_TYPE<GPS1_TYPE>` = 21 (External AHRS) (If using a GNSS-enabled "
"unit)"
msgstr ":ref:`GPS1_TYPE<GPS1_TYPE>` = 21（外部 AHRS）（如果使用具备 GNSS 功能的设备）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:170
#: 2a4e5591aec9453a9977fc0613f70151
msgid ""
":ref:`GPS2_TYPE<GPS2_TYPE>` = 21 (External AHRS) (If using a Dual GNSS-"
"enabled unit)"
msgstr ":ref:`GPS2_TYPE<GPS2_TYPE>` = 21（外部 AHRS）（如果使用具备双 GNSS 功能的设备）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:172
#: 82ceec77f3744a288314159a1fd00be2
msgid ""
"If desired, :ref:`EAHRS_SENSORS<EAHRS_SENSORS>` may be used to specify which"
" sensor data should be used by ArduPilot's filters."
msgstr ""
"如有需要，可使用 :ref:`EAHRS_SENSORS<EAHRS_SENSORS>` 指定 ArduPilot 滤波器应使用哪些传感器数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:174
#: dda10fde84854c6bae7ce5ac1762dd84
msgid ""
"Because ArduPilot's internal EKF will only update at the input IMU rate, it "
"is recommended to raise the VectorNav IMU output rate beyond the default "
"50Hz. To do so, set :ref:`EAHRS_RATE<EAHRS_RATE>` to the desired IMU rate "
"(800Hz maximum, 400Hz maximum for VN-300). Because the IMU output rate is "
"configured on initialization, an ArduPilot reset is required after changing "
":ref:`EAHRS_RATE<EAHRS_RATE>`."
msgstr ""
"由于 ArduPilot 内部 EKF 仅以输入 IMU 的速率更新，建议将 VectorNav IMU 输出速率提高到默认 50Hz 以上。为此，将 "
":ref:`EAHRS_RATE<EAHRS_RATE>` 设置为所需的 IMU 速率（最大 800Hz，VN-300 最大 400Hz）。由于 IMU"
" 输出速率在初始化时配置，更改 :ref:`EAHRS_RATE<EAHRS_RATE>` 后需要重置 ArduPilot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:177
#: 8cdb9e6610894c7a9a2ace1129eb2d21
msgid "Use as an External AHRS"
msgstr "用作外部 AHRS"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:178
#: 7a89195a5e48478d89937bf84130df0e
msgid ""
"Configuring ArduPilot to use the VectorNav sensor as an External AHRS will "
"use the VectorNav PVTA (position, velocity, time, and attitude) solution as "
"canonical rather than one of the possible internal ArduPilot filters. This "
"will allow ArduPilot to use the VectorNav sensor's INS data that combines "
"IMU and GNSS data in an advanced Kalman filtering estimation to provide "
"position, velocity, and attitude estimates of higher accuracies and with "
"better dynamic performance."
msgstr ""
"将 ArduPilot 配置为使用 VectorNav 传感器作为外部 AHRS，将使用 VectorNav 的 "
"PVTA（位置、速度、时间和姿态）解算结果作为权威来源，而非 ArduPilot 内部滤波器之一。这将允许 ArduPilot 使用 VectorNav"
" 传感器的 INS 数据，该数据通过先进的卡尔曼滤波估计融合 IMU 和 GNSS 数据，提供更高精度、更好动态性能的位置、速度和姿态估计。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:182
#: 0417d1e518a549189eef9d63864a0e61
msgid ""
"VectorNav uses the term AHRS to refer to an attitude-only solution, without "
"absolute position measurement input. VectorNav uses the term INS to refer to"
" a solution which accepts a position (often GNSS) measurement input and "
"outputs a full PVTA. Because ArduPilot's External AHRS driver requires the "
"data source (VectorNav) to provide an absolute PVT, use as an External AHRS "
"is restricted to a VectorNav INS-enabled product (VN-2X0 or VN-3X0)."
msgstr ""
"VectorNav 用「AHRS」一词指代仅输出姿态的解算，不含绝对位置测量输入。VectorNav 用「INS」一词指代接受位置（通常为 "
"GNSS）测量输入并输出完整 PVTA 的解算。由于 ArduPilot 的外部 AHRS 驱动程序要求数据源（VectorNav）提供绝对 "
"PVT，因此用作外部 AHRS 仅限于支持 VectorNav INS 的产品（VN-2X0 或 VN-3X0）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:186
#: 59e740bafa7f44b5a2f8f3a803976182
msgid "After the serial parameters have been configured, configure:"
msgstr "配置串口参数后，请配置："

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:185
#: 8ad733ce75f84ff5bec75fffa36a7fa0
msgid ":ref:`AHRS_EKF_TYPE<AHRS_EKF_TYPE>` = 11 (External AHRS)"
msgstr ":ref:`AHRS_EKF_TYPE<AHRS_EKF_TYPE>` = 11（外部 AHRS）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:186
#: c0185e62fa374ad3b4f0b05994288801
msgid ":ref:`EAHRS_TYPE<EAHRS_TYPE>` = 1 (VectorNAV)"
msgstr ":ref:`EAHRS_TYPE<EAHRS_TYPE>` = 1（VectorNav）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:189
#: ce24b4a7cba3455dbab8c0966687d53e
msgid ""
"ArduPilot's internal navigation filters run even when configured to use a "
"VectorNav as the canonical navigation source (unless internal filters are "
"disabled). As such, it is recommended to additionally configure the "
"VectorNav as an external sensor set. This allows ease of switching canonical"
" PVTA between VectorNav's and ArduPilot's navigation filters, if necessary. "
"To do this, configure the necessary paramters in Use as an External Sensor "
"Set, but leave `AHRS_EKF_TYPE<AHRS_EKF_TYPE>` as External AHRS."
msgstr ""
"即使配置为使用 VectorNav 作为权威导航来源，ArduPilot 的内部导航滤波器仍会运行（除非禁用内部滤波器）。因此，建议同时将 "
"VectorNav 配置为外部传感器组。这样在必要时可以方便地在 VectorNav 与 ArduPilot 导航滤波器的权威 PVTA "
"之间切换。为此，请按「用作外部传感器组」中的说明配置必要参数，但将 `AHRS_EKF_TYPE<AHRS_EKF_TYPE>` 保持为「外部 "
"AHRS」。"

